This special edition is CarnaVRAU, a special tribute to the Brazilian Carnaval, where we are free to celebrate love in the streets, to celebrate our music and our dance, so come with us and let's twerk;

# VRAU is a Brazillian party created in Berlin with the focus in promoting the Brazillian culture, we celebrates the variety of our music, from Baile Funk to others genres inside Brasil. We are a party made by queer people to everyone that is open to dance and celebrate.
